# openshell-pythagorean48

OpenShell wrapper crate re-exporting [SuperInstance/pythagorean48-codes](https://github.com/SuperInstance/pythagorean48-codes).

> 48 exact direction vectors for fleet trust encoding.

## Usage

```rust
use openshell_pythagorean48::{TrustVector, codebook_info};

let tv = TrustVector::from_f32(0.6, 0.8);
let (x, y) = tv.to_f32();
println!("({}, {})", x, y);
```
